+  $msg = "NeuroVault flushed and saved everything, but could not auto-eject ${dl}: because another program still has it open - most often the File Explorer window that opens automatically when you plug the drive in." + [Environment]::NewLine + [Environment]::NewLine + "Close that File Explorer window, then use Windows 'Safely Remove Hardware', or just close it and unplug. Your data is safe."
